# OS
.DS_Store

# Claude Code / superpowers working files — local only, never part of the package.
# `.claude/` and `CLAUDE.md` are the agent's configuration and project memory;
# `.superpowers/` is its workspace (ledgers, per-task briefs and reports);
# `PLAN-*.md` and `todo.md` are design notes and scratch task lists written during
# development. They are useful to keep on disk and useless to anyone cloning the
# package, so they stay untracked. Note that adding a path here does nothing for a
# file git is already tracking — those were removed from the index with
# `git rm --cached` when this section was added.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
.superpowers/
docs/superpowers/
PLAN-*.md
todo.md
